# Everything the image must NOT carry.
#
# `data/` is the important one: a local development run leaves a real SQLite
# database there, with real employees and real customer addresses in it. Copying
# it into an image would put the company's data into a layer that gets pushed to
# a registry.
data/
node_modules/
out/
release/
dist/

.git/
.github/
*.log
.DS_Store
.env
.env.*
*.local
*.tsbuildinfo
coverage/
